dwarf guard~
The Dwarf Guard~
A Dwarf Guard is here, dressed in a makeshift suit of armor.~
This small dwarf is the militia of Juargan's Kingdom.  The
small body is strong which makes him a match for any foe.  The armor of the
dwarf is of no use to anyone but him, but provides adequate defense.~
